Op code alternatives:

add ecx, ebp computes ECX = ECX + EBP.
adc ecx, ebp computes ECX = ECX + EBP + CF.

to be sure that CF is 0 can use 
clc ; ret gadget  => clear carry flag
STC ; ret gadget => set carry flag
---------------
sub ecx, ebp computes ECX = ECX - EBP.
sbb ecx, ebp => ecx = ecx - ebp - cf
